<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', width: '100%', height: '100%', gap: 40 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 340, paddingTop: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 12 }}>REASONING</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, marginBottom: 24 }}>
        激发推理<br />让模型「想清楚再做」
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 24 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        裸模型倾向「张口就来」，推理框架逼它<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>先拆解、再试错、后复盘</span>，答案质量随之跃升。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      {[
        { t: 'CoT 思维链', d: '让模型「逐步思考」，把推理过程写出来再给答案' },
        { t: '思维树 ToT', d: '并行探索多条思路，像下棋一样评估与回溯' },
        { t: 'ReAct', d: '思考(Reason)与行动(Act)交替，边想边调用工具' },
        { t: 'Reflexion', d: '做完后反思复盘，把教训写进记忆用于下一轮' },
        { t: 'Hindsight', d: '事后回顾，把经验转化为可复用的策略' },
      ].map((item, idx) => (
        <Box key={idx} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '15px 22px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, borderRadius: 12, background: idx === 2 ? 'rgba(255,159,28,0.14)' : '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <FAIcon name='brain' style={{ fill: idx === 2 ? '#FF9F1C' : '#22D3EE', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 2 }}>{item.t}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>{item.d}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 6 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>04 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
